(
    title: "The Addams Family: Pugsley\'s Scavenger Hunt",
    developer: Some("Enigma Variations"),
    description: Some("A reworking of the first game with Pugsley in Gomez\'s place: the family are held around the mansion by monsters, and the levels behind its doors can be taken in any order. Trimmed further than the console versions — the stove level, the big bird boss and Thing\'s hint boxes are all gone — but a password system survives."),
